#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This example demonstrates the capability of saving sets of simulation result.
#
#The selection to save sets of simulation results is made using the drop-down menu below the Animator: Camera dataset on the right side of the Run Control screen. For this example, the selection is "Keep 5".
#
#This example uses : ABS controller modeled in Simulink. (Libraries > Models > Models: Simulink).
#
#In one run, it uses the same settings which are in Extensions\simulink\abs_CS9.mdl. (this is the same run as Simulink and LabVIEW Models > Ext. ABS Split Mu)
#
#In another run, it ues the same abs_CS9, except it changed the brake release point setting (from slilp ratio = 0.1 to 0.4 for both front and rear).
#
#The results can plot against each other.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

